<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak shipbuilder cancels equity increase.</title>
<headline>Slovak shipbuilder cancels equity increase.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of Slovakia's sole shipbuilder Slovenske Lodenice Komarno a.s. (SL) on Monday cancelled a planned equity increase which was approved earlier this year, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said a shareholders meeting called off the plan to raise 170 million crowns to 800 million crowns, first approved in May, due to longer-than-expected negotiations with the finance ministry over the approval of the move.</p>
</text>
